OL,3,GNEWSA'Serious incident' at tiger
OL,4,Aenclosure closes park
OL,5,
OL,6,FYorkshire Ambulance Service said it had
OL,7,Fbeen called at 13:33 BST and deployed
OL,8,Fan air ambulance, two land ambulances
OL,9,Fand a doctor. The BBC has contacted the
OL,10,Fpark and South Yorkshire Police for
OL,11,Ffurther details.
